{"id":5024,"date":"2026-02-04T12:37:07","date_gmt":"2026-02-04T12:37:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/?page_id=5024"},"modified":"2026-07-07T10:49:43","modified_gmt":"2026-07-07T10:49:43","slug":"lms-redirect","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/lms-redirect\/","title":{"rendered":"LMS Redirect"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"5024\" class=\"elementor elementor-5024\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a9cd041 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a9cd041\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c9abffb elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode\" data-id=\"c9abffb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"shortcode.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-shortcode\"><!-- ============================================================\n  TS Academy \u2014 LMS Access Page\n  Paste this whole block into an Elementor HTML widget.\n  Scoped under #ts-lms so it won't leak into theme styles.\n  To update for a new cohort: search \"HAJIME\" \/ \"PHOENIX\" below.\n============================================================ -->\n<div id=\"ts-lms\">\n  <style>\n    #ts-lms {\n      --blue: #1658B7;\n      --blue-dark: #0F4291;\n      --mint: #12F8C0;\n      --mint-dark: #0BC79B;\n      --ink: #10161F;\n      --muted: #5B6472;\n      --line: #E4E9F1;\n      --bg: #F6F8FC;\n      --card: #FFFFFF;\n\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 100%;\n      overflow-x: hidden;\n      background: var(--bg);\n      padding: clamp(32px, 6vw, 56px) clamp(14px, 4vw, 20px) clamp(40px, 7vw, 64px);\n      border-radius: 20px;\n      font-family: 'Poppins', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n      letter-spacing: 0.012em;\n      color: var(--ink);\n    }\n    #ts-lms *, #ts-lms *::before, #ts-lms *::after { box-sizing: border-box; min-width: 0; }\n\n    #ts-lms .lms-header {\n      max-width: 800px;\n      margin: 0 auto 40px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .lms-eyebrow {\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      color: var(--blue);\n      margin: 0 0 14px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n    #ts-lms h1 {\n      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 38px);\n      line-height: 1.15;\n      letter-spacing: 0.015em;\n      word-spacing: 0.1em;\n      margin: 0 0 12px;\n      color: var(--ink);\n    }\n    #ts-lms .lms-sub {\n      font-size: clamp(14px, 2.4vw, 15.5px);\n      line-height: 1.6;\n      letter-spacing: 0.015em;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n\n    #ts-lms .board {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: clamp(16px, 3vw, 40px);\n      max-width: 1280px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    \/* ---- LMS card ---- *\/\n    #ts-lms .pass {\n      flex: 1 1 340px;\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 560px;\n      height: auto !important;\n      max-height: none !important;\n      background: var(--card);\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      box-shadow: 0 16px 36px -18px rgba(16,88,183,0.28);\n      border: 1px solid var(--line);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .pass-top {\n      height: 6px;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .pass.blue .pass-top { background: var(--blue); }\n    #ts-lms .pass.mint .pass-top { background: var(--mint); }\n\n    #ts-lms .pass-head {\n      padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 22px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 24px) 6px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .lms-tag {\n      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n      padding: 5px 12px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      color: #fff;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .pass.blue .lms-tag { background: var(--blue); }\n    #ts-lms .pass.mint .lms-tag { background: var(--mint-dark); }\n\n    #ts-lms .pass-platform { padding: 12px clamp(16px, 4vw, 24px) 6px; }\n    #ts-lms .pass-platform .label {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      margin: 0 0 6px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .pass-platform .url {\n      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n      font-size: clamp(17px, 3.6vw, 21px);\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 0.01em;\n      word-break: break-word;\n      overflow-wrap: break-word;\n      margin: 0 0 18px;\n      color: var(--ink);\n    }\n\n    #ts-lms .roster {\n      padding: 4px clamp(16px, 4vw, 24px) 24px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 12px;\n      flex-grow: 1;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .roster .label {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-weight: 600;\n      margin: 0 0 2px;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .roster-row {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 10px;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      font-size: 14.5px;\n      line-height: 1.45;\n      letter-spacing: 0.015em;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .roster-row .dot {\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n      width: 7px; height: 7px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      margin-top: 6px;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .pass.blue .roster-row .dot { background: var(--blue); }\n    #ts-lms .pass.mint .roster-row .dot { background: var(--mint-dark); }\n    #ts-lms .roster-row strong { font-weight: 700; }\n    #ts-lms .roster-row span.exception {\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: 13px;\n      display: block;\n      margin-top: 1px;\n    }\n\n    #ts-lms .tear {\n      position: relative;\n      height: 0;\n      border-top: 2px dashed var(--line);\n    }\n    #ts-lms .tear::before,\n    #ts-lms .tear::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -10px;\n      width: 20px; height: 20px;\n      background: var(--bg);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .tear::before { left: -10px; }\n    #ts-lms .tear::after { right: -10px; }\n\n    #ts-lms .pass-stub {\n      padding: 22px clamp(16px, 4vw, 24px) clamp(32px, 6vw, 40px);\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .cta {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      color: #fff;\n      padding: 15px 18px;\n      min-height: 50px;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      transition: transform 0.15s ease, filter 0.15s ease;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .pass.blue .cta { background: var(--blue); }\n    #ts-lms .pass.mint .cta { background: var(--mint-dark); }\n    #ts-lms .cta:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); filter: brightness(1.08); }\n    #ts-lms .cta:focus-visible {\n      outline: 3px solid var(--mint);\n      outline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n\n    #ts-lms .helper {\n      max-width: 860px;\n      margin: 32px auto 0;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 13.5px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.015em;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      line-height: 1.6;\n      padding: 0 8px;\n    }\n\n    \/* ---- FAQ \/ troubleshooting ---- *\/\n    #ts-lms .faq {\n      max-width: 900px;\n      margin: clamp(36px, 6vw, 56px) auto 0;\n      background: var(--card);\n      border: 1px solid var(--line);\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      padding: 8px 0;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .faq-title {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      padding: 20px clamp(18px, 4vw, 26px) 4px;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .faq-title .dot-badge {\n      width: 8px; height: 8px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: var(--mint-dark);\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .faq-title h2 {\n      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 19px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n      word-spacing: 0.12em;\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--ink);\n    }\n    #ts-lms .faq-sub {\n      padding: 0 clamp(18px, 4vw, 26px) 18px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.015em;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .faq-steps {\n      padding: 4px clamp(18px, 4vw, 26px) 22px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 16px;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .faq-step {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 14px;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .faq-num {\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n      width: 26px; height: 26px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: var(--blue);\n      color: #fff;\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 12.5px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      margin-top: 1px;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .faq-step-body h3 {\n      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n      word-spacing: 0.12em;\n      margin: 0 0 4px;\n      color: var(--ink);\n    }\n    #ts-lms .faq-step-body p {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.55;\n      letter-spacing: 0.015em;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n    #ts-lms .faq-step-body a {\n      color: var(--blue);\n      text-decoration: underline;\n    }\n\n    \/* Tablet: stack to single column earlier, like the reference page's grid (968px) *\/\n    @media (max-width: 968px) {\n      #ts-lms .board {\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: stretch;\n        max-width: 640px;\n      }\n      #ts-lms .pass {\n        max-width: 100%;\n        flex: 0 0 auto;   \/* height driven by content, not the 340px row basis *\/\n      }\n      #ts-lms h1 { font-size: clamp(26px, 5vw, 32px); }\n    }\n\n    \/* Large phone \/ small tablet *\/\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      #ts-lms { padding: 40px clamp(14px, 4vw, 20px) 48px; }\n      #ts-lms .lms-header { margin-bottom: 32px; }\n      #ts-lms .board { gap: 24px; }\n      #ts-lms .pass-head,\n      #ts-lms .pass-platform,\n      #ts-lms .roster,\n      #ts-lms .pass-stub { padding-left: 22px; padding-right: 22px; }\n      #ts-lms .pass-platform .url { font-size: 19px; }\n      #ts-lms .lms-sub { font-size: 14.5px; }\n    }\n\n    \/* Mobile *\/\n    @media (max-width: 480px) {\n      #ts-lms { border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px 14px 40px; }\n      #ts-lms .lms-header { margin-bottom: 26px; }\n      #ts-lms h1 { font-size: 24px; }\n      #ts-lms .lms-sub { font-size: 14px; }\n      #ts-lms .board { gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n      #ts-lms .pass-head,\n      #ts-lms .pass-platform,\n      #ts-lms .roster,\n      #ts-lms .pass-stub { padding-left: 18px; padding-right: 18px; }\n      #ts-lms .pass-platform .url { font-size: 18px; }\n      #ts-lms .roster-row { font-size: 14px; }\n      #ts-lms .faq { border-radius: 12px; }\n      #ts-lms .faq-title,\n      #ts-lms .faq-sub,\n      #ts-lms .faq-steps { padding-left: 18px; padding-right: 18px; }\n      #ts-lms .faq-step { gap: 12px; }\n      #ts-lms .cta { min-height: 52px; font-size: 16px; }\n    }\n\n    \/* Small phone *\/\n    @media (max-width: 360px) {\n      #ts-lms h1 { font-size: 21px; }\n      #ts-lms .pass-icon,\n      #ts-lms .lms-tag { font-size: 12px; }\n      #ts-lms .pass-platform .url { font-size: 17px; }\n      #ts-lms .faq-num { width: 24px; height: 24px; font-size: 11.5px; }\n    }\n\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n      #ts-lms .cta { transition: none; }\n    }\n  <\/style>\n\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https:\/\/fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link href=\"https:\/\/fonts.googleapis.com\/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n  <div class=\"lms-header\">\n    <p class=\"lms-eyebrow\">LMS Access \u00b7 TS Academy<\/p>\n    <h1>Which platform is yours?<\/h1>\n    <p class=\"lms-sub\">Two platforms host TS Academy courses. Find your cohort below to log in to the right one \u2014 most students only need one.<\/p>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"board\">\n\n    <!-- LMS 1 -->\n    <div class=\"pass blue\">\n      <div class=\"pass-top\"><\/div>\n      <div class=\"pass-head\">\n        <span class=\"lms-tag\">LMS 1<\/span>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"pass-platform\">\n        <p class=\"label\">Platform<\/p>\n        <p class=\"url\">app.tsacademyonline.com<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"roster\">\n        <p class=\"label\">For<\/p>\n        <div class=\"roster-row\">\n          <span class=\"dot\"><\/span>\n          <span><strong>Hajime Cohort<\/strong> \u2014 all students, all courses<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"roster-row\">\n          <span class=\"dot\"><\/span>\n          <span>\n            <strong>Phoenix Cohort<\/strong> \u2014 all students\n            <span class=\"exception\">except Marketing &amp; Graphics Design (see LMS 2)<\/span>\n          <\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"tear\"><\/div>\n      <div class=\"pass-stub\">\n        <a class=\"cta\" href=\"https:\/\/app.tsacademyonline.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access LMS 1 \u2192<\/a>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <!-- LMS 2 -->\n    <div class=\"pass mint\">\n      <div class=\"pass-top\"><\/div>\n      <div class=\"pass-head\">\n        <span class=\"lms-tag\">LMS 2<\/span>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"pass-platform\">\n        <p class=\"label\">Platform<\/p>\n        <p class=\"url\">learn.tsacademyonline.com<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"roster\">\n        <p class=\"label\">For<\/p>\n        <div class=\"roster-row\">\n          <span class=\"dot\"><\/span>\n          <span>\n            <strong>Phoenix Cohort<\/strong> \u2014 Marketing &amp; Graphics Design students only\n            <span class=\"exception\">all other Phoenix students use LMS 1<\/span>\n          <\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"tear\"><\/div>\n      <div class=\"pass-stub\">\n        <a class=\"cta\" href=\"https:\/\/learn.tsacademyonline.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access LMS 2 \u2192<\/a>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n  <\/div>\n\n  <p class=\"helper\">\n    Not sure which cohort you're in? Check your enrollment email or ask in your cohort's WhatsApp group.\n  <\/p>\n\n  <!-- FAQ \/ troubleshooting -->\n  <div class=\"faq\">\n    <div class=\"faq-title\">\n      <span class=\"dot-badge\"><\/span>\n      <h2>Trouble logging in?<\/h2>\n    <\/div>\n    <p class=\"faq-sub\">If your LMS won't load or your login keeps failing, work through these steps in order.<\/p>\n    <div class=\"faq-steps\">\n\n      <div class=\"faq-step\">\n        <span class=\"faq-num\">1<\/span>\n        <div class=\"faq-step-body\">\n          <h3>Clear browser cache and cookies<\/h3>\n          <p>Open Chrome \u2192 three-dot menu \u2192 More Tools \u2192 Clear Browsing Data. Select \"Cookies and other site data\" and \"Cached images and files,\" then click Clear Data.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-step\">\n        <span class=\"faq-num\">2<\/span>\n        <div class=\"faq-step-body\">\n          <h3>Disable browser extensions<\/h3>\n          <p>Some extensions can interfere with login. Go to the three-dot menu \u2192 More Tools \u2192 Extensions, disable all extensions, then try logging in again.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-step\">\n        <span class=\"faq-num\">3<\/span>\n        <div class=\"faq-step-body\">\n          <h3>Update Chrome<\/h3>\n          <p>Make sure Chrome is on the latest version. <a href=\"https:\/\/support.google.com\/chrome\/answer\/95414\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to update Chrome<\/a>.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-step\">\n        <span class=\"faq-num\">4<\/span>\n        <div class=\"faq-step-body\">\n          <h3>Try Incognito Mode<\/h3>\n          <p>Open Chrome in Incognito Mode and attempt to log in.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-step\">\n        <span class=\"faq-num\">5<\/span>\n        <div class=\"faq-step-body\">\n          <h3>Disable Hardware Acceleration<\/h3>\n          <p>Go to Chrome Settings \u2192 System \u2192 toggle off \"Use hardware acceleration when available.\"<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>LMS Access \u00b7 TS Academy Which platform is yours? Two platforms host TS Academy courses. Find your cohort below to log in to the right one<span class=\"excerpt-hellip\"> [\u2026]<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":-1,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"inline_featured_image":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5024","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v27.0 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>LMS Redirect - TS Academy - Redefining Learning for the Future Workforce<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Join 1,000+ learners who\u2019ve launched high-payingtech careers\u2014no experience required.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com